OL,3,GNEWSANorth and south Derbyshire
OL,4,Acouncils plan withdrawn
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for a major shake-up of local
OL,7,Fcouncils in Derbyshire have been
OL,8,Fwithdrawn by the government.
OL,10,FOn Thursday, ministers said plans to
OL,11,Fcreate a north and south council in
OL,12,FDerbyshire - which they had previously
OL,13,Fgiven the green light - would now be
OL,14,Freconsidered along with several other
OL,15,Fareas, including Nottinghamshire and
OL,16,FLeicestershire.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,362,360,200,160,0,100
