OL,3,GNEWSANorth and south Derbyshire
OL,4,Acouncils plan withdrawn
OL,5,
OL,6,FAmber Valley leaders had recently
OL,7,Fstarted the process of a legal
OL,8,Fchallenge against the plans, which
OL,9,Fwould have controversially involved
OL,10,Fsplitting the borough between the two
OL,11,Fnew unitary authorities.
OL,13,FThe government said every area would
OL,14,Fhave an outcome by early next year and
OL,15,F"all options remain under
OL,16,Fconsideration".
